('interrogative-end','Direct yes/no questions','Keep the final he after a genuine complete direct question.','hë ti haro he?','hë ti haro?','docs/grammar.md §§7,36'),
('wh-object-case','Object question word','The recorded object question form khe-m is licensed in the standard grammar.','hë ti khe-m shëma he?','hë ti khe shëma?','docs/grammar.md §§7,36'),
('purposeful-ellipsis','Chat fragments and labels','Use omissions only when the result is a non-sentential label or short answer.','nu','mi nu haro.','docs/grammar.md §§46,51'),
('resonance-not-consent','Social intent','Warm or cheerful resonance never implies consent.','hë ti mahori he?','më ti mahori.','docs/grammar.md §§41,65'),
('repair-content','Correction','The marker dënaro changes an earlier claim only when a specific corrected statement follows.','sen dënaro mi ti-m daru-yu.','dënaro','docs/grammar.md §53'),
('repair-hearing','Misheard words','Mishearing and retracting a prior proposition use different discourse cues.','hë hëwo ti haro he?','qëlo','docs/grammar.md §§41,53'),
('noncoercive-invitation','Invitation','tëqoro / pëshu mark non-pressure but do not manufacture agreement.','më tëqoro ti mi-wa goro ya.','më ti mi-wa goro.','docs/grammar.md §§41,65'),
('reported-evidence','Source tracking','hu is reported; si direct experience; ye inference; do not upgrade the evidence.','sen sa goro-te hu.','sen sa goro-te si.','docs/grammar.md §§5,55'),
('modal-ability','Ability','Ability -ki is a capacity claim, not permission.','hë ti goro-ki he?','hë ti goro-ho he?','docs/grammar.md §§5,7'),
('modal-permission','Permission','Permission -ho cannot be inferred from ability or a cheerful tone.','hë ti goro-ho he?','hë ti goro-ki he?','docs/grammar.md §§5,7'),
