('contrast-correction','Scoped correction','Use independent marked sentences for changes of resonance.','nëm mi nu shiri.','nëm mi nu shiri, zha mi haro.','docs/grammar.md §§2,53'),
('shared-ground','Discourse stance','nësho means previously established common ground, not new evidence.','sen nësho mi haro.','sen mi haro si.','docs/grammar.md §35'),
('paraphrase-versus-quote','Reported speech','qëhano and wëlëmi frame different quotation relations.','sen wëlëmi mi ti-m nashi.','sen qëhano mi ti-m nashi.','docs/grammar.md §52'),
('question-not-rhetorical','Rhetoric','An actually answer-seeking question is not automatically rhetorical.','hë ti haro he?','hë yëhano ti haro he?','docs/grammar.md §56'),
